_(Vast.ai API Key)_:
: <div class="vast-input-group">
    <input type="password" id="vast_api_key_field" name="API_KEY" style="width: 380px;" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($api_key, ENT_QUOTES)?>" placeholder="_(Enter your Vast.ai API Key)_" required>
    <button type="button" class="button" onclick="toggleApiKeyVisibility()"><i id="vast_eye_icon" class="fa fa-eye"></i></button>
