    <option value="60"  <?=$interval===60 ?'selected':''?>>60 _(seconds)_</option>
    <option value="120" <?=$interval===120?'selected':''?>>2 _(minutes)_</option>
    <option value="0"   <?=$interval===0  ?'selected':''?>>_(Off / Manual only)_</option>
  </select>
  <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.75;">_(Interval for automatic background status polling on the dashboard.)_</span>

_(Local Cache Expiration)_:
