    <option value="15"  <?=$cache_ttl===15 ?'selected':''?>>15 _(seconds)_</option>
    <option value="30"  <?=$cache_ttl===30 ?'selected':''?>>30 _(seconds - Recommended)_</option>
    <option value="60"  <?=$cache_ttl===60 ?'selected':''?>>60 _(seconds)_</option>
    <option value="120" <?=$cache_ttl===120?'selected':''?>>2 _(minutes)_</option>
  </select>
  <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.75;">_(Protects against API rate limits across multiple open dashboard tabs.)_</span>

_(Dashboard Placement)_:
